repository-code: "https://github.com/Andnog/pursuit-capture-audit"
url: "https://andnog.github.io/pursuit-capture-audit/"
abstract: >-
  An audit of capture endpoints for multi-vehicle pursuit in microscopic urban traffic
  simulation (SUMO, fifteen real downtown networks): a library that scores an episode under
  proximity rules and under an operational capture rule, the code of the study as it ran, its
  sealed evidence packages with checksums, its registration records, and the instructions to
  verify, recompute and run every study again.
keywords:
  - multi-vehicle pursuit
  - evaluation methodology
  - microscopic traffic simulation
  - SUMO
  - multi-agent reinforcement learning
